{"_id":"about","_type":"about","heading":"About","paragraph":"I’m Ramy, a Video generalist and former Team Lead with experience across reels, documentaries, news reports, and large-scale event coverage, including the World Government Summit, Davos, One Billion Summit, The Economist, World’s Coolest Winter, and Emirates Love. I’ve worked with clients such as Hala Kazim, Anas Bukhash, McDonald’s, Elsewedy Electric, Al Maryah Island, and Blue Cherry. I studied Computer Science at SCU, then developed my creative career through a Graphic Design specialization at CalArts, advanced animation training at The School of Motion, and Cinematic Videography at SAE Dubai. I’m also a Golden Visa holder under Dubai Culture & Arts Authority.","portrait":{"_type":"image","_sanityAsset":"image@file://web/public/media/portrait.jpg","alt":"Ramy George at the edit suite"},"links":[{"_key":"l0","_type":"linkItem","visible":true,"label":"More on the Info page →","kind":"info"},{"_key":"l1","_type":"linkItem","visible":true,"label":"LinkedIn","kind":"linkedin"},{"_key":"l2","_type":"linkItem","visible":true,"label":"Email","kind":"email"}],"homepageParagraph":"I’m Ramy, a video generalist based in Dubai. Editing is where I spend most of my time, but I also work across motion, design, sound and camera. I’ve worked on everything from news and documentaries to podcasts, social content and branded work."}
